<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L453" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal" spaceabove="10">We want to overlay the graphs for the two algorithms.  To do this, we'll assign the results of the <Hyperlink linktarget="Help:plot" hyperlink="true"><Font executable="false" style="Maple Input" underline="true">plot</Font></Hyperlink> command to a name instead of displaying them.  We use different colors for the plots and ensure that the views are the same.</Text-field>
</Input>
